"pos":[-680,1180],"size":[330,120],"flags":{"allow_interaction":true},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"utils/小珠光Noto","properties":{"text":"手写词曲&自动词曲切换\n1：自动歌词\n2：手动歌词","fontSize":19,"fontColor":"#ffffff","backgroundColor":"#790202","backgroundAlpha":0.8,"borderRadius":8,"padding":12,"lineHeight":1.4,"textAlign":"left"},"color":"transparent","bgcolor":"transparent"},{"id":2,"type":"SaveAudio","pos":[50,680],"size":[423.38555908203125,209.80332946777344],"flags":{},"order":37,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"audio","localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":18},{"label":"filename_prefix","localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"}},{"label":"audioUI","localized_name":"音频UI","name":"audioUI","type":"AUDIO_UI","widget":{"name":"audioUI"}}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SaveAudio","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.10.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.5.2"},"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["audio/ComfyUI"]},{"id":6,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1740,580],"size":[610,520],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"参考备注","properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["# 参数说明\n\n| 参数名称                  | 含义                     | 默认值    | 作用与影响                                                                                               | 取值范围/说明                     |\n| :------------------------ | :----------------------- | :-------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :-------------------------------- |\n| **`max_audio_length_ms`** | 最大音频长度 (毫秒)      | 240000    | 设置输入音频的最长允许时长。<br>**作用**：超过此时长的音频会被自动截断，确保处理音频在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。 | 240000 ms = 240 秒 (4 分钟)       |\n| **`topk`**                | Top-K 采样               | 50        | 生成时仅从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。<br>**作用**：`值越大` → 结果越丰富但可能发散；`值越小` → 结果越聚焦但可能单调。常用于平衡生成结果的多样性与连贯性。 | 正整数                            |\n| **`temperature`**         | 温度系数                 | 1.0       | 控制生成结果的随机性。<br>**作用**：<br>- `>1.0` (高)：生成更随机、更具创意性<br>- `<1.0` (低)：生成更保守、更倾向高概率内容<br>- `=1.0`：严格按模型预测概率采样，不做调整。 | 浮点数 (通常 >0)                 |\n| **`cfg_scale`**           | 无分类器引导系数         | 1.5       | 控制提示词 (Prompt) 对生成结果的影响强度。<br>**作用**：<br>- `值越高` → 结果越严格遵循提示词<br>- `值越低` → 结果更自由，受提示词约束更小。 | 常见范围 1~10<br>1.5 属较低引导强度 |\n\n## 补充说明\n\n*   **`max_audio_length_ms`**: 截断机制保护系统资源，是处理长音频时的关键安全设置。\n*   **`topk`**: 广泛应用于文本生成、语音合成、音乐生成等需要控制输出多样性的场景。\n*   **`temperature`**: 是调整生成“创造力”或“保守性”的核心参数之一。\n*   **`cfg_scale`**: 较低的引导强度 (如 1.5) 适合希望生成结果在遵循提示的同时保留一定自由度和创造性的场景。"],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":34,"type":"easy textSwitch","pos":[730,680],"size":[270,78],"flags":{},"order":33,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"文本_1","localized_name":"文本_1","name":"text1","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":40},{"label":"文本_2","localized_name":"文本_2","name":"text2","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":41},{"label":"输入","localized_name":"输入","name":"input","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"input"},"link":43}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[36]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"easy textSwitch","cnr_id":"comfyui-easy-use","ver":"5ec3b5ef861fe45c4e9966d17c4546e943417723"},"widgets_values":[1]},{"id":37,"type":"ImpactInt","pos":[-330,1230],"size":[270,58],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"值","localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"整数","localized_name":"整数","name":"INT","type":"INT","links":[43,44]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ImpactInt","cnr_id":"comfyui-impact-pack","ver":"6a517ebe06fea2b74fc41b3bd089c0d7173eeced"},"widgets_values":[2],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":36,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-690,990],"size":[640,160],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text",