k":50}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"输出","name":"output","type":"*","links":null}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"easy showAnything"},"widgets_values":["[intro]  \n咯咯咯~小手拍拍，笑声开满园  \n\n[verse]  \n小红帽蹦蹦跳，滑梯上云朵飘  \n小熊饼干香喷喷，老师唱歌像魔法  \n彩虹伞下转圈圈，笑声比阳光还亮  \n\n[pre-chorus]  \n啦啦啦~跳起来，不怕跌倒  \n每个角落都有惊喜在等你奔跑  \n\n[chorus]  \n快乐幼儿园，我的小天地  \n画笔涂出彩虹，梦想不打烊  \n老师温柔像妈妈，朋友手牵手  \n每天都是新冒险，笑到没烦恼  \n\n[post-chorus]  \n啦~啦~啦~  \n快乐幼儿园，最棒的舞台  \n\n[verse]  \n积木搭城堡，橡皮泥捏恐龙  \n小青蛙呱呱叫，池塘边捉迷藏  \n午睡梦里飞上天，星星当枕头  \n\n[pre-chorus]  \n啦啦啦~唱起来，不怕孤单  \n每个笑容都是最甜的糖果  \n\n[chorus]  \n快乐幼儿园，我的小天地  \n画笔涂出彩虹，梦想不打烊  \n老师温柔像妈妈，朋友手牵手  \n每天都是新冒险，笑到没烦恼  \n\n[bridge]  \n铃铛叮叮当，放学铃声响  \n小书包背背上，回家路上唱  \n明天还要来，继续玩不够  \n快乐幼儿园，永远不长大  \n\n[chorus]  \n快乐幼儿园，我的小天地  \n画笔涂出彩虹，梦想不打烊  \n老师温柔像妈妈，朋友手牵手  \n每天都是新冒险，笑到没烦恼  \n\n[outro]  \n咯咯咯~再见啦，明天见  \n快乐幼儿园，永远在心田"]},{"id":42,"type":"llama_cpp_parameters","pos":[-170,3730],"size":[260,346],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"最大令牌数","localized_name":"最大令牌数","name":"max_tokens","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_tokens"},"link":null},{"label":"采样候选数","localized_name":"采样候选数","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null},{"label":"核采样阈值","localized_name":"核采样阈值","name":"top_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"top_p"},"link":null},{"label":"最小概率阈值","localized_name":"最小概率阈值","name":"min_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"min_p"},"link":null},{"label":"典型采样阈值","localized_name":"典型采样阈值","name":"typical_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"typical_p"},"link":null},{"label":"温度系数","localized_name":"温度系数","name":"temperature","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"temperature"},"link":null},{"label":"重复惩罚","localized_name":"重复惩罚","name":"repeat_penalty","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"repeat_penalty"},"link":null},{"label":"频率惩罚","localized_name":"频率惩罚","name":"frequency_penalty","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"frequency_penalty"},"link":null},{"label":"出现惩罚","localized_name":"出现惩罚","name":"presence_penalty","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"presence_penalty"},"link":null},{"label":"Mirostat 模式","localized_name":"Mirostat 模式","name":"mirostat_mode","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"mirostat_mode"},"link":null},{"label":"Mirostat 学习率","localized_name":"Mirostat 学习率","name":"mirostat_eta","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"mirostat_eta"},"link":null},{"label":"Mirostat 目标值","localized_name":"Mirostat 目标值","name":"mirostat_tau","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"mirostat_tau"},"link":null},{"label":"状态UID","localized_name":"状态UID","name":"state_uid","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"state_uid"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"参数集","localized_name":"参数集","name":"parameters","type":"LLAMACPPARAMS","links":[47,53]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"llama_cpp_parameters","aux_id":"lihaoyun6/ComfyUI-llama-cpp_vllm","ver":"da1a561d1ae3f0c298fe98850ed4ab2833d1c998"},"widgets_values":[1024,30,0.9,0.05,1,0.8,1,0,1,0,0.1,5,-1]},{"id":43,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-170,4130],"size":[550,170],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[49]}],"title":"提示词工程","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline"},"widgets_values":["You are a professional songwriter. Your task is to generate song lyrics based on the specific inputs provided below.\n\nPlease fill in the following variables before generating:\n\nTheme: {{THEME}}  (e.g., \"Lost love in Tokyo\", \"Cyberpunk battle\", \"Peaceful morning\")\n\nMusic Style/Tags: {{STYLE}} (e.g., \"Pop, Emotional, Piano\", \"Heavy Metal, Fast\", \"Folk, Acoustic\")\n\nLanguage: {{LANGUAGE}} (e.g., \"English\", \"Chinese\", \"Japanese\")\n\nFormat Requirements (CRITICAL)\n\nText Case: Use lowercase for all lyrics text (aesthetic choice for AI music models). Keep Structure Tags in Title Case (e.g., [Chorus]).\n\nStructure Tags: strictly use square brackets [] for song sections.\n\nSpacing:\n\nEach structure tag must be on its own line.\n\nSeparate different sections with one empty line.\n\nClean Output:\n\nNO timestamps (e.g., do NOT use [00:12]).\n\nNO extra explanations or conversational filler. Output only the lyrics.\n\nLength: Keep lyrics concise and suitable for a standard 3-4 minute song.\n\nStructure Guidelines & Valid Tags\n\nUse the following tags to structure the song dynamically:\n\n[Intro]: (Optional) 1-4 lines. Sets the atmosphere.\n\n[Verse]: Story-telling part. Typically 4-8 lines.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]: (Optional) 2-4 lines. Builds tension leading into the Chorus.\n\n[Chorus]: The main hook. Catchy, repetitive, and emotional. 4-8 lines.\n\n[Post-Chorus]: (Optional) A short hook or refrain after the chorus.\n\n[Bridge]: (Optional) Provides contrast in melody/rhythm. 4-8 lines.\n\n[Instrumental] / [Interlude]: Use this tag to indicate a section with no vocals.\n\n[Solo]: Specific instrumental solo (e.g., [Guitar Solo]).\n\n[Outro]: Closing section. Fading out or final thoughts. 1-4 lines.\n\nExample Output Format\n\n[Intro]\n\n[Verse]\nneon lights reflect on the rain\nwashing away the hidden pain\nwalking alone through the city gray\nlooking for a reason to stay\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nthe rhythm beats inside my chest\nput the weary heart to test\n\n[Chorus]\nfly away into the night\nchasing after distant light\nnothing left for us to fear\nmagic moments calling here\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Bridge]\nbreaking chains and breaking walls\nanswering the siren calls\n\n[Chorus]\nfly away into the night\nchasing after distant light\n\n[Outro]\nfading out\ninto the dark\n\nNow generate lyrics in the specified language based on the theme and style provided above.\nOutput ONLY the lyrics with structure tags. DO NOT include any introductory text, explanations, or closing remarks."]},{"id":44,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-650,4020],"size":[400,300],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[55]}],"title":"提示词工程","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline"},"widgets_values":["You are a professional music style analyst and tagging assistant for the HeartMuLa music generation model.\n\nYour task is to analyze a user's request (which may be a song theme, a mood description, or a lyric fragment) and generate a precise, comma-separated list of style tags.\n\nCRITICAL RULE: You must ONLY select tags from the \"Supported Tags Database\" below. Do not invent new tags. If a user's description doesn't perfectly match, select the closest available tag from the list.\n\nSupported Tags Database\n\n1. Genre (流派)\nPop, Folk, Ballad, Electronic, Rock, Acoustic, R&B, Indie, Dance, Indie Pop, J-Pop, Hip-Hop, Country, Latin, Alternative, Christian, Cantopop, Gospel, Soul, Mandopop\n\n2. Instrument (乐器)\nDrums, Piano, Guitar, Strings, Synthesizer, Bass, Acoustic Guitar, Keyboard, Electronic Drums, Vocals, Drum Machine, Electric Guitar, Percussion, Beat, Orchestra, Saxophone, Accordion, Voice, String, Vocal\n\n3. Mood (情绪)\nMelancholy, Romantic, Energetic, Hopeful, Dreamy, Relaxed, Sad, Calm, Cheerful, Reflective, Emotional, Joyful, Sentimental, Uplifting, Warm, Peaceful, Upbeat, Gentle, Nostalgic, Epic\n\n4. Scene (场景)\nDriving, Road Trip, Cafe, Relaxing, Wedding, Meditation, Workout, Walking, Alone, Travel, Reflection, Rainy Day, Night, Church, Coffee Shop, Gym, Gaming, Study, Dating, Date\n\n5. Singer Timbre (歌手音色)\nSoft, Clear, Warm, Gentle, Smooth, Sweet, Emotional, Mellow, Powerful, Youthful, Bright, Rough, Raspy, Melodic, Deep, Soulful, Strong, Energetic, Breathy, Passionate\n\n6. Topic (主题)\nLove, Relationship, Hope, Longing, Loss, Heartbreak, Memory, Reflection, Life, Faith, Regret, Freedom, Breakup, Nature, Loneliness, Dreams, Nostalgia, Romance, Friendship, Youth\n\n7. Gender (性别)\nMale, Female\n\nOutput Format\n\nOutput ONLY the comma-separated tags.\n\nDo not add explanations.\n\nAim for a mix of Genre, Instrument, and Mood at minimum.\n\nExample Output: pop,piano,emotional,love,soft\n\nUser Request:\n\n[Insert User Description Here]"]},{"id":45,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-650,3840],"size":[390,130],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[54]}],"title":"歌曲故事及歌手性别","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline"},"widgets_values":["幼儿老师的快乐故事\n歌手性别：女"]},{"id":46,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-560,3700],"size":[220,88],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":4,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"注释","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.1"},"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["# 歌曲风格标签"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":47,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-650,3500],"size":[430,150],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[48]}],"title":"歌曲主题和风格","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline"},"widgets_values":["主题：快乐幼儿园\n音乐风格：流行,儿歌\n节奏:2/4拍\n语言：中文\n歌手性别：女"]},{"id":48,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-540,3360],"size":[230,88],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":4,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"注释","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.1"},"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["# 歌曲名称，风格节奏等\n\n"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":49,"type":"easy showAnything","pos":[940,3850],"size":[390,230],"flags":{},"order":26,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"输入任何","localized_name":"输入任何","name":"anything","shape":7,"type":"*","link":51}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"输出","name":"output","type":"*","links":null}],"pr